{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07749","headline":"闻裴侍御朏自襄州司户除豫州司户因以投寄 · 孟浩然","name":"闻裴侍御朏自襄州司户除豫州司户因以投寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人荆府掾，尚有柏台威。\n移职自樊衍，芳声闻帝畿。\n昔余卧林巷，载酒过柴扉。\n松菊无时赏，乡园欲懒归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07749.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07749","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}